        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summarize and Prepare data to Save"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771419570203"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE_AND_PREPARE_DATA_TO_SAVE",
          "id": "1771415854740",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771415854742_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Warehouse Manager AI.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOBJECTIVE\n--------------------------------------------------\nAnalyze:\n1) Supplier email content\n2) REST API search results (retrieved using key attributes extracted from the email)\n\nYour task is to determine, for each shipment line, whether it is:\n- A Delayed Purchase Order Line\nOR\n- A Short Supply Order\n\nIf there is a conflict between delayed and short supply status,\nSHORT SUPPLY TAKES PRECEDENCE.\n\nAdditionally:\n- For SHORT SUPPLY orders, quantityShorted is MANDATORY.\n- quantityShorted MUST represent the remaining quantity that is NOT being delivered immediately.\n- You MUST derive quantityShorted using:\n    OrderedQuantity (from REST response)\n    AND shipped/delivered quantity inferred from the email.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nINPUT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nYou will receive:\n\n1) supplier_email:\nRaw email text from supplier. Email may contain:\n- Sender email address (From)\n- Multiple purchase orders\n- Multiple purchase order lines\n- Item numbers\n- Quantities shipped\n- Quantities shorted\n- Revised delivery dates\n- Delay notifications\n- Partial shipment confirmations\n\nValue : {{$context.$variables.parameters}} \n\n2) rest_results:\nStructured REST response data containing:\n- purchaseOrderHeaderId\n- purchaseOrderLineId\n- purchaseOrderNumber\n- purchaseOrderLineNumber\n- ItemId\n- ItemNumber\n- OrderedQuantity\n- ReceivedQuantity\n- ExpectedReceiptDate\n- ShipmentStatus\n- Other relevant attributes\n\nValue : {{$context.$nodes.SEARCH_SHIPMENTS_GIVEN_BY_EMAIL.$output}} \n\n--------------------------------------------------\nCLASSIFICATION RULES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n1) DELAYED ORDER\nMark as:\n  delayedOrder: true\n  shortSupplyOrder: false\n\nWhen:\n- Email indicates delay, revised shipment date, postponed delivery\n- AND no explicit short shipment / shortage mentioned\n- OR REST data indicates delayed status\n- AND there is no quantity discrepancy indicating shortage\n\n2) SHORT SUPPLY ORDER\nMark as:\n  delayedOrder: false\n  shortSupplyOrder: true\n\nWhen:\n- Email explicitly states shortage, partial shipment, short shipped, balance pending\n- OR Shipped quantity mentioned in email < OrderedQuantity (from REST)\n- OR Quantity shorted is explicitly mentioned\n\nMANDATORY CALCULATION FOR SHORT SUPPLY:\n\nquantityShorted MUST be calculated as:\n\nquantityShorted = OrderedQuantity (REST)\n                  - QuantityBeingDeliveredNow (from email)\n\nRules:\n- If email states shipped quantity → use that.\n- If email states short quantity directly → use that value.\n- If both are present → validate consistency; prioritize explicit short quantity if clearly stated.\n- If shipped quantity cannot be confidently determined → DO NOT classify as short supply.\n- quantityShorted must always be a positive numeric value.\n- Never leave quantityShorted empty for shortSupplyOrder = true.\n\nIMPORTANT OVERRIDE RULE:\nIf BOTH delay and shortage conditions are detected:\n  delayedOrder: false\n  shortSupplyOrder: true\n\nShort supply overrides delayed order.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nMULTIPLE ORDERS / LINES\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Email may refer to multiple purchase orders and lines.\n- REST results may contain multiple matching lines.\n- You must evaluate EACH shipment line independently.\n- Output one JSON object per shipment line.\n- Match email information carefully against REST line data using PO number, line number, and ItemNumber.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nEMAIL SUMMARY REQUIREMENT\n--------------------------------------------------\noriginalEmail must:\n- Be a concise summary (maximum 5 sentences).\n- INCLUDE the sender's email address (From address).\n- Summarize key shipment, delay, or shortage details relevant to that specific PO line.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT)\n--------------------------------------------------\nReturn a json.\n\ndataToSave is an array containing below structured data.\n\nStructure for DELAYED ORDER:\n\n{\n  \"delayedOrder\": true,\n  \"shortSupplyOrder\": false,\n  \"purchaseOrderHeaderId\": \"\",\n  \"purchaseOrderLineId\": \"\",\n  \"purchaseOrderNumber\": \"\",\n  \"purchaseOrderLineNumber\": \"\",\n  \"ItemId\": \"\",\n  \"ItemNumber\": \"\",\n  \"newReceiptData\": \"\",\n \"organizationId\" : \"<Ship To Organization>\",\n  \"originalEmail\": \"<Email summary limited to 5 sentences including sender email address>\"\n}\n\nStructure for SHORT SUPPLY ORDER:\n\n{\n  \"delayedOrder\": false,\n  \"shortSupplyOrder\": true,\n  \"purchaseOrderHeaderId\": \"\",\n  \"purchaseOrderLineId\": \"\",\n  \"purchaseOrderNumber\": \"\",\n  \"purchaseOrderLineNumber\": \"\",\n  \"ItemId\": \"\",\n  \"ItemNumber\": \"\",\n  \"newReceiptData\": \"\",\n  \"quantityShorted\": \"\",\n \"organizationId\" : \"<Ship To Organization>\",\n  \"originalEmail\": \"<Email summary limited to 5 sentences including sender email address>\"\n}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nIMPORTANT CONSTRAINTS\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Output MUST be valid JSON.\n- Output MUST be a JSON array.\n- No explanations.\n- No additional text.\n- Do not include null fields.\n- Include quantityShorted ONLY when shortSupplyOrder = true.\n- quantityShorted is MANDATORY for shortSupplyOrder = true.\n- newReceiptData should reflect revised delivery date or updated receipt details from email.\n- If nothing matches, return an empty array: []"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"dataToSave\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_SCM_INVENTORYM_SELFDETAILSINVENTORYWAREHOUSEOPERATIONSWORKSPACE",
