          "code": "SELF_DETAILS",
          "id": "1771658563123",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Delayed Shipments Prompt",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const delayedShipmentsCount =\n  $context.$nodes.DELAYED_SHIPMENTS_ES.$output?.hits?.total?.value ?? 0;\n\nconst delayedShipments =\n  $context?.$nodes?.DELAYED_SHIPMENTS_ES?.$output?.hits?.hits ?? [];\n\nconst supplierEmailDelayedCount =\n   $context.$nodes.FILTERED_EMAILS_BY_ORGANIZATION.$output.result?.length ?? 0;\n\n \n\n \n\nconst supplierEmailDelayedDetails =\n    $context.$nodes.FILTERED_EMAILS_BY_ORGANIZATION.$output.result ?? [];\n\nconst prompt = `\n<delayedShipmentsCount>${delayedShipmentsCount}</delayedShipmentsCount>\n<delayedShipmentsOrderDetails>${JSON.stringify(delayedShipments)}</delayedShipmentsOrderDetails>\n\n<supplierEmailDelayedCount>${supplierEmailDelayedCount}</supplierEmailDelayedCount>\n<supplierEmailDelayedDetails>${JSON.stringify(supplierEmailDelayedDetails)}</supplierEmailDelayedDetails>\n\nTask:\nYou must evaluate TWO independent rows:\n\nROW 1 → Delayed Shipments (system detected)\n- If delayedShipmentsCount > 0, generate exactly ONE \"message widget list row\".\n- Title MUST be:\n  \"Delayed Shipments (${delayedShipmentsCount})\"\n- If delayedShipmentsCount = 0, DO NOT generate this row.\n\nROW 2 → Supplier Email Delays\n- If supplierEmailDelayedCount > 0, generate exactly ONE \"message widget list row\".\n- Title MUST be:\n  \"Supplier Reported Delays (${supplierEmailDelayedCount})\"\n- If supplierEmailDelayedCount = 0, DO NOT generate this row.\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nROW 1 ACTION\n--------------------------------------------------\nora.Agent({\n  \"command\": \"showDetailedInfoOnDelayedOrders\",\n  \"subAgent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_SHIPMENTS_ADVISOR\",\n  \"agent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_ADVISOR\"\n})\n\nDescription requirements (ROW 1):\n- Use delayed shipment order details to create a clear, user-friendly summary.\n- Mention customer name(s) and item(s).\n- Keep it concise and suitable for a single row.\n- If multiple delayed orders exist:\n  - Summarize (e.g., \"X delayed orders\"),\n  - Include one example (customer + items), OR\n  - List a few customers/items followed by \"and more\".\n- If data is missing, fall back to a generic but meaningful description.\n- Must clearly indicate that delayed shipments are present and can be viewed.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nROW 2 ACTION\n--------------------------------------------------\nora.Agent({\n  \"command\": \"showDetailedInfoOnShortSupplyOrders\",\n  \"subAgent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_SHIPMENTS_ADVISOR\",\n  \"agent\": \"INV_WH_OPS_INBOUND_ADVISOR\"\n})\n\nDescription requirements (ROW 2):\n- Use supplierEmailDelayedDetails and supplier email summary data.\n- Clearly indicate that supplier(s) have reported purchase order delays via email.\n- Mention supplier name(s), PO number(s), and item(s) when available.\n- Keep it concise and suitable for a single row.\n- If multiple supplier emails exist:\n  - Summarize (e.g., \"X supplier delay notifications\"),\n  - Include one example (supplier + PO + item), OR\n  - List a few followed by \"and more\".\n- If key attributes are missing, generate a meaningful generic summary.\n- Must clearly indicate that supplier-reported delays can be reviewed.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n`.trim();\n\nreturn prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DELAYED_SHIPMENTS_PROMPT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771675163885",
          "id": "1771215256211",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
